      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## GEM-X Video Motion Capture + FBX Character Retargeting\n\n1. **Load Video:** Select a video file. In **Trim Video**, set `start_time` (start time in seconds) and `duration` (length to keep in seconds; `0` means until the end of the video).\n\n2. **Run:** Click **Run** to perform motion capture first, then retarget the captured motion to the three characters on the right (**Mixamo / Unreal / Unity**).\n\n3. **Preview Animation:** Click the Play button in each **Preview 3D** node to view the animation. The retargeted character FBX files are also saved in `output/gem_x/<task>/`.\n\n### Retarget Node Settings\n\n- **character:** Select a character from `models/gem_x/fbx`.\n- **root_motion:** Disable this option to keep the character animated in place (without moving across the scene).\n- **yaw_offset:** Adjust the character's facing direction (rotation around the vertical axis).\n\n**Note:** Finger movements are not currently retargeted. Characters will retain their default hand poses.\n\n\n---\n\n\nGEM-X 视频动捕 + FBX 角色重定向\n\n1. Load Video 选择视频；Trim Video 设置 start_time（开始秒）和 duration（保留秒数，0 = 到结尾）。\n2. 点击 Run：先做动作捕捉，再把动作重定向到右侧三个角色（Mixamo / Unreal / Unity）。\n3. 每个 Preview 3D 节点里点播放按钮查看动画；角色 FBX 也保存在 output/gem_x/<任务>/ 下。\n\nRetarget 节点参数：character 选 models/gem_x/fbx 里的角色；root_motion 关闭后原地播放；yaw_offset 调整朝向。\n手指暂不重定向，保持角色默认手型。"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## GEM-X Video Motion Capture + FBX Character Retargeting\n\n1. **Load Video:** Select a video file. In **Trim Video**, set `start_time` (start time in seconds) and `duration` (length to keep in seconds; `0` means until the end of the video).\n\n2. **Run:** Click **Run** to perform motion capture first, then retarget the captured motion to the three characters on the right (**Mixamo / Unreal / Unity**).\n\n3. **Preview Animation:** Click the Play button in each **Preview 3D** node to view the animation. The retargeted character FBX files are also saved in `output/gem_x/<task>/`.\n\n### Retarget Node Settings\n\n- **character:** Select a character from `models/gem_x/fbx`.\n- **root_motion:** Disable this option to keep the character animated in place (without moving across the scene).\n- **yaw_offset:** Adjust the character's facing direction (rotation around the vertical axis).\n\n**Note:** Finger movements are not currently retargeted. Characters will retain their default hand poses.\n\n\n---\n\n\nGEM-X 视频动捕 + FBX 角色重定向\n\n1. Load Video 选择视频；Trim Video 设置 start_time（开始秒）和 duration（保留秒数，0 = 到结尾）。\n2. 点击 Run：先做动作捕捉，再把动作重定向到右侧三个角色（Mixamo / Unreal / Unity）。\n3. 每个 Preview 3D 节点里点播放按钮查看动画；角色 FBX 也保存在 output/gem_x/<任务>/ 下。\n\nRetarget 节点参数：character 选 models/gem_x/fbx 里的角色；root_motion 关闭后原地播放；yaw_offset 调整朝向。\n手指暂不重定向，保持角色默认手型。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
